\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55358 \u56800  Why Include Questions\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Even though your JSON already holds policy data, customers won\'92t ask in clause language \'97 they\'92ll use natural speech.\
