\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The user says: \'93I missed my payment \'97 what happens now?\'94\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Without linked 
\f1\b question mappings
\f0\b0 , your chatbot won\'92t know that\'92s a 
\f2\i Late Payment
\f0\i0  query.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 So, to train or match intent, you need:\
